              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susan W"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved the results I had with this chocolate mocha icing. I didn't make any changes except to double the recipie. It was gooey ooey! Just perfect! The texture was ideal in that it was very easy to spread on my cooled cake. I waited an hour for the icing to set on the cake so I could take a spoon and make fancy swirls. I will definitely make this icing again. There is absolutely nothing wrong with the measurements of the ingredients as some have said. See for yourself like I did.",
